{"id":2412,"date":"2017-06-28T14:44:54","date_gmt":"2017-06-28T13:44:54","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/www.cefri.fr\/?p=2412"},"modified":"2017-10-05T08:22:52","modified_gmt":"2017-10-05T07:22:52","slug":"attestation-dequivalence-afenuc","status":"publish","type":"post","link":"https:\/\/www.cefri.fr\/attestation-dequivalence-afenuc\/","title":{"rendered":"Attestation d\u2019\u00e9quivalence AFENUC"},"content":{"rendered":"[vc_row][vc_column][vc_column_text]A la suite d\u2019une initiative soutenue par EDF, le CEFRI a eu le plaisir, en mars 2017, de d\u00e9livrer l\u2019attestation d\u2019\u00e9quivalence n\u00b0 08 EQ RN-RP1\/RN-SCN1 \u00e0 l\u2019AFENUC (Association Fran\u00e7aise des \u00e9tablissements scolaires pr\u00e9parant des formations du Nucl\u00e9aire).<!--more--><\/p>\n<p>&nbsp;<\/p>\n<p>Il s\u2019agit d\u2019un regroupement de lyc\u00e9es dont les apprentis pr\u00e9parant un \u00ab\u00a0<em>Bac Professionnel Techniques d\u2019intervention sur Installations Nucl\u00e9aires\u00a0\u00bb<\/em> ou un \u00ab\u00a0<em>BTS Environnement Nucl\u00e9aires (EN)\u00a0\u00bb <\/em>\u00a0sont amen\u00e9s \u00e0 entrer en INB dans le cadre de leur formation.<\/p>\n<p>&nbsp;<\/p>\n<p>Les formations dispens\u00e9es par les lyc\u00e9es adh\u00e9rents sont r\u00e9put\u00e9es conformes aux cahiers des charges CEFRI F.<\/p>\n<p>&nbsp;<\/p>\n<p>Pour pouvoir entre en zone au cours de leurs formations, les apprentis concern\u00e9s ont besoin d\u2019une attestation de formation RN-RP1 et\/ou RN-SCN1.<\/p>\n<p>Ils pourront l\u2019obtenir aupr\u00e8s d\u2019un Organisme de Formation certifi\u00e9 CEFRI \u00e0 partir d\u2019un justificatif d\u00e9livr\u00e9 par le lyc\u00e9e au cours de leurs \u00e9tudes.[\/vc_column_text][\/vc_column][\/vc_row]\n","protected":false},"excerpt":{"rendered":"<p>[vc_row][vc_column][vc_column_text]A la suite d\u2019une initiative soutenue par EDF, le CEFRI a eu le plaisir, en mars 2017, de d\u00e9livrer l\u2019attestation d\u2019\u00e9quivalence n\u00b0 08 EQ RN-RP1\/RN-SCN1 \u00e0 l\u2019AFENUC (Association Fran\u00e7aise des \u00e9tablissements scolaires pr\u00e9parant des formations du Nucl\u00e9aire).<\/p>\n","protected":false},"author":61,"featured_media":2606,"comment_status":"closed","ping_status":"closed","sticky":false,"template":"","format":"standard","meta":{"footnotes":""},"categories":[29],"tags":[],"class_list":["post-2412","post","type-post","status-publish","format-standard","has-post-thumbnail","hentry","category-public"],"_links":{"self":[{"href":"https:\/\/www.cefri.fr\/json\/wp\/v2\/posts\/2412","targetHints":{"allow":["GET"]}}],"collection":[{"href":"https:\/\/www.cefri.fr\/json\/wp\/v2\/posts"}],"about":[{"href":"https:\/\/www.cefri.fr\/json\/wp\/v2\/types\/post"}],"author":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/www.cefri.fr\/json\/wp\/v2\/users\/61"}],"replies":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/www.cefri.fr\/json\/wp\/v2\/comments?post=2412"}],"version-history":[{"count":0,"href":"https:\/\/www.cefri.fr\/json\/wp\/v2\/posts\/2412\/revisions"}],"wp:featuredmedia":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/www.cefri.fr\/json\/wp\/v2\/media\/2606"}],"wp:attachment":[{"href":"https:\/\/www.cefri.fr\/json\/wp\/v2\/media?parent=2412"}],"wp:term":[{"taxonomy":"category","embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/www.cefri.fr\/json\/wp\/v2\/categories?post=2412"},{"taxonomy":"post_tag","embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/www.cefri.fr\/json\/wp\/v2\/tags?post=2412"}],"curies":[{"name":"wp","href":"https:\/\/api.w.org\/{rel}","templated":true}]}}